{
  "name": "Surface Integrity (composite objective on the public surface)",
  "description": "The cards a visitor sees at gaius.zndx.org are current, clean, and conserved: newest visible date within newest_days; at least min_current_share of the first band cards within current_days; top card published within refresh_hours; no marketing/aggregation shape, no goggle-discarded domain, no duplicate source URL among published cards; no published\u2192archived transition in the window without a declared-category reason. Verdicts are pass|fail|error per gate, never inconclusive; each FAIL names the DAG stage; the flip is the smallest declared action that restores PASS. (2026-09-07: two integrity gates added \u2014 surface_ordered: the page reads newest-first by the content's own date, 0 inversions; surface_dates_present: every visible card is dated. User: 'a casual visitor sees fresh, well-ordered content: proof the pipelines work'.). (2026-09-07: conversation aspect \u2014 Agenda horizon a voice session receives: lede is prose not dump; each session poses an ask; spoken brief matches tomorrow/week occupancy; \u22653 horizon items imply \u22652 intents and \u22651 session.)",
  "modality": "Structured facts (JSON) collected from the live page, collections.cards, the Brave goggle and collections.content_events",
  "diagram": null,
  "citations": [
    "docs/notes/2026-09-04/175500_content_currency_surface_reframe.md",
    "docs/notes/2026-09-05/214400_published_surface_remediation_and_drift.md",
    "docs/notes/2026-09-06/103000_adversarial_content_on_the_surface.md",
    "external/sdg-strategy/objective/tasks/causal-chain-analysis-in-verification-loops.md",
    "docs/scratch/2026-09-07/234500_surface_integrity_agenda_conversation.md"
  ],
  "params": {
    "newest_days": 2,
    "current_days": 7,
    "band": 26,
    "min_current_share": 0.5,
    "refresh_hours": 13,
    "conservation_window_hours": 168,
